   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roundness": null,
   "text": "Keep sampling while the trainer works.\nA group starts while started groups < window,\nwindow = (msop, +1 when idle) \u00d7 groups_per_step\n  + the groups expected to drop.\nA closed window never stops a running rollout.",
   "originalText": "Keep sampling while the trainer works.\nA group starts while started groups < window,\nwindow = (msop, +1 when idle) \u00d7 groups_per_step\n  + the groups expected to drop.\nA closed window never stops a running rollout.",
