   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roundness": null,
   "text": "ceil(prestart_allowance \u00d7 64) = 7 extra\nadmissions, so a sandbox is ready when a\nsampling slot frees. Only on top of the full\ntarget: under backpressure no new group\nstarts early. A started group's siblings always fill.",
   "originalText": "ceil(prestart_allowance \u00d7 64) = 7 extra\nadmissions, so a sandbox is ready when a\nsampling slot frees. Only on top of the full\ntarget: under backpressure no new group\nstarts early. A started group's siblings always fill.",
